cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JacoPy in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "JacoPy"
abstract: >-
  JacoPy is a pure-Python library for graded algebra, bracket calculus,
  and metric-affine and generalized geometry in which every
  manipulation is recorded as a step-by-step proof with its rules,
  literature sources and assumptions.
authors:
